         <photoshop:TextLayers>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>TONY BLAND         EDUCATION/CERTIFICATIONS  JACKSONVILLE UNIVE</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>TONY BLAND         EDUCATION/CERTIFICATIONS  JACKSONVILLE UNIVERSITY  JAX, FL I 2002 - 2006 B.S. Computer Science  INTERTECH JAX, FL I MAY 2018 Angular Certificate  GOOGLE/COURSERA UX Design Certificate  ACTIVE SECURITY CLEARANCE US Government  CORE COMPETENCIES  Software  Adobe Photoshop   Adobe Illustrator Adobe XD  Zeplin  Figma  Sketch  Digital.ai Balsamiq lnVision Axure   Programming   HTML  CSS  Angular  Bootstrap  JavaScript   A FEW THOUGHTS ON DESIGN  I obsess over the details and consider the nuances of design to be crucial when creating intuitive products.  I thrive in organizations where I can advocate for modern practices and foster  a culture of design excellence. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>https://tonybland.myportfolio.com/  https://www.linkedin.com/in</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>https://tonybland.myportfolio.com/  https://www.linkedin.com/in/tony-bland/  Tbland0930@gmail.com  Mobile: 813.608.6373 </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Hands-on Product UX Design Leader with over 15 years of experie</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Hands-on Product UX Design Leader with over 15 years of experience successfully leading cross-functional teams through the entire design process, from ideation to execution. A passion for crafting seamless user experiences and a proven track record of delivering innovative design solutions. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>EXPERIENCE  AMERICORPS - REMOTE Senior UX/UI Designer  Designed</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>EXPERIENCE  AMERICORPS - REMOTE Senior UX/UI Designer  Designed UX/UI for US Government learning platform with AI search Responsible for creative design such as photos, colors, typography, etc Collaborated with developers, QA, and stakeholders to conduct UAT Created complex design system, design artifacts, and documentation Led UX research efforts used to build user personas, journey maps, etc   NESTLEâ€™ HEALTH SCIENCE - BOSTON, MA Senior Manager, UX/UI  Developed UX/UI strategies for B2B/B2C healthcare products Conducted research to identify and solve customer pain points Hands-on design of mobile and desktop design solutions/systems Established and tracked departmental and individual OKRs/KPIs   LANDSTAR - JAX, FL Senior User Interface Designer  Used Figma to create wireframes and high-fidelity mock ups  Managed and mentored internal and external design teams Collaborated with QA to test and deliver front-end code  Built and managed design libraries and design artifacts   DUVAL COUNTY PUBLIC SCHOOLS - JAX, FL  Manager, UX/UI Created mock-ups and prototypes to support products and services for 183 schools and 125,000 students within the school district Supervised team of UX designers to design a $5m turn-key web portal, in partnership with Microsoft   XCEL TESTING SOLUTIONS - JAX, FL  Director, User Experience Managed team of UX designers responsible for creating learning management system content Implemented design guides and patterns to govern overall integrity and consistency of digital products   STELLAR - JAX, FL  Senior User Interface Designer Owner of the user experience strategy for enterprise web, mobile, and SharePoint applications </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Design  User Research Discovery  User Interface  User Experienc</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Design  User Research Discovery  User Interface  User Experience  Product Design Storyboarding  iOS/Android  Design Systems Prototyping  Wireframing   Others  Agile/Scrum Jira Smartsheet SaaS Leadership </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>JUNE 2011 FEB 2012</photoshop:LayerName>
